300
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:02,360
please reflect it to

301
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,759
the Student Affairs Office.

302
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,000
Before that,

303
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:05,879
please don't disturb

304
00:11:05,879 --> 00:11:06,799
our recruitment work.

305
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,120
Fine.

306
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:10,600
We won't leave today.

307
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:11,720
Yeah.

308
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,799
We'll see

309
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:17,200
who you can recruit.

310
00:11:40,080 --> 00:11:40,799
Seniors,

311
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:43,240
I should be the one

312
00:11:43,240 --> 00:11:43,799
you're targeting.

313
00:11:44,919 --> 00:11:45,919
Don't make them feel uncomfortable.

314
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,480
Zhou Yang,

315
00:11:48,639 --> 00:11:50,159
how dare you show up here?

316
00:11:50,159 --> 00:11:52,480
If you hadn't bailed last year,

317
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:53,919
we wouldn't have lost so badly.

318
00:11:53,919 --> 00:11:54,759
You're the one

319
00:11:54,759 --> 00:11:55,840
who ruined the Yibei Basketball Club.

320
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:00,000
If I remember correctly,

321
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:01,960
when we were behind in the score,

322
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:02,879
it was you two

323
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:05,279
who committed malicious fouls

324
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:06,159
and almost got the team banned.

325
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,480
Fu Binbin,

326
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,720
why do you always meddle in other people's business?

327
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,039
The Student Union

328
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,480
is responsible for the order of recruitment.

329
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,759
Those who come to stir up trouble

330
00:12:14,759 --> 00:12:15,399
should be dealt with.

331
00:12:16,039 --> 00:12:16,600
And

332
00:12:17,159 --> 00:12:18,440
you said the basketball club is garbage.

333
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:19,639
Weren't you

334
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:20,639
on the team before?

335
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,039
What are you?

336
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:23,279
You...

337
00:12:27,799 --> 00:12:28,799
Mr. Qian is strictly enforcing

338
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:29,879
the school rules this week.

339
00:12:30,279 --> 00:12:32,080
You two are in the last year of high school.

340
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:33,480
If you don't want to get into trouble,

341
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,200
you'd better stop here.

342
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:39,720
Fine.

343
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,120
Zhou Yang,

344
00:12:41,399 --> 00:12:42,279
this isn't over.

345
00:12:43,519 --> 00:12:44,200
What are you looking at?

346
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:47,240
Zhou Yang,

347
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:47,720
thank you.

348
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,080
It's okay.

349
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,399
Since you're an old member,

350
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,679
why don't you come back?

351
00:12:56,039 --> 00:12:57,039
Let me think about it.

352
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,000
Fine.

353
00:13:30,639 --> 00:13:32,120
I was absent from the last term's competition.

354
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,320
It was indeed my fault.

355
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,440
But I have already

356
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,919
apologized to you.

357
00:13:35,919 --> 00:13:36,960
I have also resigned from the club.

358
00:13:37,279 --> 00:13:38,320
What else do you want?

359
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:40,200
What about your attitude this morning?

360
00:13:41,679 --> 00:13:43,000
What do you think we want?

361
00:13:43,320 --> 00:13:44,159
Zhou Yang.

362
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:49,600
Let him go.

363
00:13:55,399 --> 00:13:56,440
Lin Qingyuan.

364
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,600
Zhou Yang, go.

365
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,639
Leave it to me.

366
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:16,080
You're just a freshman.

367
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:17,120
Are you looking for trouble?

368
00:14:17,559 --> 00:14:18,960
Don't come any closer.

369
00:14:19,480 --> 00:14:21,279
I know Taekwondo,

370
00:14:22,360 --> 00:14:23,240
karate,

371
00:14:24,159 --> 00:14:25,559
and Muay Thai.

372
00:14:32,320 --> 00:14:32,919
Beat him!

373
00:14:52,799 --> 00:14:54,039
[That strength...]

374
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,000
[Left-handed pitcher...]

375
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,679
[Could he be...]

376
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:12,840
There's a new camera.

377
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:18,080
If I remember correctly,

378
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:19,360
you should already have

379
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,840
received several penalties.

380
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,840
If you get into more trouble,

381
00:15:23,840 --> 00:15:25,559
you might miss the college entrance exam.

382
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,759
Lin Qingyuan, are you okay?

383
00:15:57,639 --> 00:15:58,240
What's wrong?

384
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:00,639
I'm fine.

385
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:22,559
Here.

386
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,000
Thank you.

387
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:37,600
You just said

388
00:16:38,320 --> 00:16:40,080
the left-handed three-point master

389
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:40,879
isn't me?

390
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:42,840
I've never heard of him

391
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:43,919
in the basketball club before.

392
00:16:44,799 --> 00:16:45,759
What?

393
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,720
He wasn't in the club

394
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:48,639
before?

395
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:50,120
You joined the club

396
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,399
just to find him?

397
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:53,759
First,

398
00:16:53,759 --> 00:16:55,080
I need to find him.

399
00:16:55,759 --> 00:16:56,960
Then...

400
00:16:57,960 --> 00:16:58,679
Wait.

401
00:16:58,679 --> 00:16:59,759
Let me show you a video.

402
00:17:03,759 --> 00:17:04,519
This is me.

403
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:09,680
Impressive!

404
00:17:10,799 --> 00:17:12,160
This was my first shot.

405
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,119
I just threw it casually.

406
00:17:15,119 --> 00:17:16,759
With my talent,

407
00:17:16,759 --> 00:17:18,279
if I find a master

408
00:17:18,279 --> 00:17:19,519
and get his guidance,

409
00:17:23,599 --> 00:17:24,519
I'll be invincible.

410
00:17:27,839 --> 00:17:29,480
Even if you're not a basketball master,

411
00:17:29,480 --> 00:17:30,319
it's okay.

412
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:32,480
That move in the alley

413
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:33,319
was pretty cool too.

414
00:17:35,839 --> 00:17:37,640
Those guys said

415
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:40,319
the team lost last year

416
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:41,480
because you weren't there.

417
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:44,400
That means you're really good.

418
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:45,319
This year,

419
00:17:45,319 --> 00:17:46,240
let's win it back together.

420
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:04,720
Come on.

421
00:18:06,559 --> 00:18:07,720
You love basketball,

422
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:08,200
right?

423
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:26,359
Can you fill out the form

424
00:18:26,359 --> 00:18:27,000
tomorrow?

425
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,279
Sure.

426
00:18:34,319 --> 00:18:35,640
Great!

427
00:18:35,640 --> 00:18:38,920
Zhou Yang has joined us.

428
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,279
Zhou Yang,

429
00:18:47,279 --> 00:18:48,720
see you at the basketball club tomorrow.

430
00:19:09,319 --> 00:19:10,559
Mom, I'm back.

431
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:12,880
My son is back.

432
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,920
How do you like high school?

433
00:19:17,359 --> 00:19:18,359
It's fine.

434
00:19:19,920 --> 00:19:21,920
You always say that.

435
00:19:22,319 --> 00:19:23,279
Are you thirsty?

436
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:24,920
I prepared

437
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,759
your favorite juice.

438
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,400
How do you get along

439
00:19:29,400 --> 00:19:30,440
with your new classmates?

440
00:19:30,599 --> 00:19:31,400
How do you feel?

441
00:19:31,839 --> 00:19:33,400
Did you make any new friends?

442
00:19:34,839 --> 00:19:35,720
As usual.

443
00:19:36,279 --> 00:19:36,960
Mom,

444
00:19:37,319 --> 00:19:38,240
did you show my new semester plan

445
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:39,359
to my dad?

446
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:43,279
You really forgot.

447
00:19:44,960 --> 00:19:46,519
I did it on purpose.

448
00:19:47,039 --> 00:19:48,160
Your dad is in Germany

449
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:49,799
as a visiting lecturer.

450
00:19:49,799 --> 00:19:51,240
He can't control you.

451
00:19:51,240 --> 00:19:52,119
You should

452
00:19:52,119 --> 00:19:53,880
relax these two months.

453
00:19:54,319 --> 00:19:55,480
Don't always be so tense.

454
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:57,000
Be like Gu.

455
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,279
Smile.

456
00:20:01,519 --> 00:20:02,400
Yeah.

457
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,880
Learn from me.

458
00:20:05,519 --> 00:20:06,200
Let's go out

459
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:06,920
to eat today

460
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,240
and celebrate.

461
00:20:09,359 --> 00:20:10,880
Mom, I have homework to do.

462
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:12,000
You can do it later.

463
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,240
Let's take advantage

464
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:15,599
of your dad's absence

465
00:20:15,599 --> 00:20:16,200
and enjoy

466
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,440
our freedom.

467
00:20:17,759 --> 00:20:18,400
Let's go.

468
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:19,319
Let's go eat something delicious.

469
00:20:22,480 --> 00:20:23,599
I'm back.

470
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:24,960
Don't come back.

471
00:20:25,240 --> 00:20:25,880
Keep an eye on it.

472
00:20:25,880 --> 00:20:26,880
I'm changing guns.

473
00:20:26,880 --> 00:20:28,119
I'm watching.

474
00:20:28,119 --> 00:20:29,119
There's a tank on the opposite slope.

475
00:20:29,119 --> 00:20:30,319
I can't hold it.

476
00:20:30,319 --> 00:20:31,119
What can you hold?

477
00:20:31,119 --> 00:20:32,039
It's hitting me.

478
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:32,440
Come on.

479
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,599
I see it.

480
00:20:34,519 --> 00:20:35,599
One more.

481
00:20:35,599 --> 00:20:37,000
Where is the last one?

482
00:20:37,000 --> 00:20:38,359
Find it.

483
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:39,559
Where?

484
00:20:39,559 --> 00:20:40,480
In the grass ahead.

485
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,519
Grass.

486
00:20:41,519 --> 00:20:42,319
Near the grass.

487
00:20:42,640 --> 00:20:43,279
Be careful.

488
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:44,319
Nice.

489
00:20:45,160 --> 00:20:45,960
We won.

490
00:20:46,400 --> 00:20:47,599
Perfect.

491
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,240
Son, are you hungry?

492
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:50,759
Ready to eat.

493
00:20:50,759 --> 00:20:51,640
Let's eat.

494
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:53,319
The dishes are all here.

495
00:20:53,319 --> 00:20:54,519
Please, everyone, enjoy your meal.

496
00:20:54,519 --> 00:20:56,000
Come on, cheers.

497
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,599
Cheers.

498
00:21:01,079 --> 00:21:03,039
Congratulations to Yuan

499
00:21:03,039 --> 00:21:04,519
on becoming a high school student.

500
00:21:05,519 --> 00:21:06,079
Son,

501
00:21:06,079 --> 00:21:07,519
wish you happy studying.

502
00:21:07,519 --> 00:21:08,759
Learn happily.

503
00:21:08,759 --> 00:21:09,440
Okay.

504
00:21:13,119 --> 00:21:14,039
But Ye,

505
00:21:15,279 --> 00:21:17,400
can't we eat something healthier?

506
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:18,759
These are too oily.

507
00:21:18,839 --> 00:21:21,200
Oily things make me happy.

508
00:21:23,039 --> 00:21:24,240
Got it, got it.

509
00:21:24,759 --> 00:21:26,119
Let's go to another restaurant tomorrow.

510
00:21:26,119 --> 00:21:27,079
The main thing today is that we have coupons.

511
00:21:27,079 --> 00:21:28,039
We have to use the coupons.

512
00:21:28,039 --> 00:21:29,519
Ye is really good at this.

513
00:21:29,519 --> 00:21:30,880
I'm a master at managing the household.

514
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:31,839
Hurry up and eat.

515
00:21:34,079 --> 00:21:35,079
By the way, Yuan,

516
00:21:35,920 --> 00:21:37,200
how's the search for the master going?

517
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,319
Still haven't found him yet.

518
00:21:39,119 --> 00:21:40,359
There's no one at the basketball club either.

519
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:41,599
Why?

520
00:21:41,599 --> 00:21:42,480
I don't know.

521
00:21:42,640 --> 00:21:43,839
If you can't find him, just forget it.

522
00:21:43,839 --> 00:21:44,599
Have fun.

523
00:21:44,599 --> 00:21:45,480
Thank you, Bro Lin.

524
00:21:45,839 --> 00:21:46,759
We are buddies.

525
00:21:46,759 --> 00:21:47,720
Don't mention it.

526
00:21:48,079 --> 00:21:48,839
Anyway, your grandfather,

527
00:21:48,839 --> 00:21:50,039
my father, has spoken.

528
00:21:50,039 --> 00:21:51,599
He will sponsor whatever you want to learn.

529
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:53,960
It's your dad and my grandfather.

530
00:21:55,160 --> 00:21:57,000
It's just a hobby.

531
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:58,279
There's no need to be so competitive.

532
00:21:58,279 --> 00:21:59,279
And anyway,

533
00:21:59,279 --> 00:22:01,400
the basketball club has been there all along.

534
00:22:01,400 --> 00:22:02,240
Take your time.

535
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:03,640
Maybe you'll find someone.

536
00:22:04,720 --> 00:22:05,480
By the way,

537
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:06,119
I have something

538
00:22:06,119 --> 00:22:07,039
you like here.

539
00:22:09,279 --> 00:22:09,839
Got it.

540
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,839
Nothing is more important than eating.

541
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:13,920
Eat up.

542
00:22:13,920 --> 00:22:14,519
Let's eat.

543
00:22:18,599 --> 00:22:19,839
Mom, I'm back.

544
00:22:20,599 --> 00:22:21,440
Yang, you're back.

545
00:22:21,440 --> 00:22:22,440
Dinner is ready.

546
00:22:22,440 --> 00:22:23,079
Okay.

547
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:27,480
Here.

548
00:22:28,160 --> 00:22:29,039
For you.

549
00:22:29,039 --> 00:22:29,720
Wipe your hands.

550
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,559
You have work tonight?

551
00:22:37,799 --> 00:22:38,599
Yeah.

552
00:22:38,880 --> 00:22:40,359
A new project has started recently.

553
00:22:40,359 --> 00:22:41,440
There will be more work.

554
00:22:41,759 --> 00:22:42,759
But it's okay.

555
00:22:42,759 --> 00:22:43,559
No matter how busy I am,

556
00:22:43,559 --> 00:22:44,440
I still have time

557
00:22:44,440 --> 00:22:45,559
to eat with you.

558
00:22:46,319 --> 00:22:46,960
Let's eat.

559
00:22:47,160 --> 00:22:47,759
Mom,

560
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:50,240
if you're really busy,

561
00:22:50,240 --> 00:22:51,720
you don't have to cook for me.

562
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:52,519
It's okay.

563
00:22:52,519 --> 00:22:53,880
Spaghetti is simple.

564
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:54,480
Besides,

565
00:22:54,480 --> 00:22:55,880
you're still growing,

566
00:22:55,880 --> 00:22:56,880
can't always eat takeout.

567
00:23:11,440 --> 00:23:12,240
Yang,

568
00:23:13,319 --> 00:23:14,640
how's school going?

569
00:23:14,640 --> 00:23:16,200
Is the new term going well?

570
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:17,839
It's all good, don't worry.

571
00:23:18,240 --> 00:23:19,279
What about the club?

572
00:23:19,279 --> 00:23:19,920
Still playing basketball

573
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:21,160
with Fu Binbin and the others?

574
00:23:23,839 --> 00:23:25,680
Actually, it's good to exercise,

575
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:26,960
it's good for health.

576
00:23:31,119 --> 00:23:32,880
Is there anything fun at school?

577
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:33,839
Tell me.

578
00:23:42,160 --> 00:23:42,880
Mom,

579
00:23:43,119 --> 00:23:44,839
why don't you go to work?

580
00:23:45,119 --> 00:23:46,160
Don't be late.

581
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:50,200
Okay, I'll take this call.

582
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,039
Eat up.

583
00:23:53,079 --> 00:23:53,640
Hello?

584
00:24:17,519 --> 00:24:18,759
I've decided to go back to the basketball club.

585
00:24:19,039 --> 00:24:20,000
Wanna join me?

586
00:24:54,720 --> 00:24:55,279
What?

587
00:24:55,960 --> 00:24:56,880
Does it make you feel awkward

588
00:24:57,640 --> 00:24:59,079
to have no father?

589
00:25:00,400 --> 00:25:01,400
No.

590
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,119
It's just that someone

591
00:25:02,119 --> 00:25:03,039
sent me a message.

592
00:25:11,599 --> 00:25:13,319
I'll have a check-up this weekend.

593
00:25:13,319 --> 00:25:14,920
Last time, Dr. Qin said

594
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:16,519
you were recovering well.

595
00:25:16,519 --> 00:25:17,640
Your physical condition

596
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:19,480
is almost healthy.

597
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:21,559
Yeah.

598
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:23,240
He also said

599
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,599
I could start exercising again.

600
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:25,960
Exercising?

601
00:25:26,880 --> 00:25:28,599
Are you going to play basketball again?

602
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:34,480
Yeah.

603
00:25:34,960 --> 00:25:35,720
No way.

604
00:25:36,240 --> 00:25:36,759
Yan,

605
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:38,960
this isn't just about you.

606
00:25:39,559 --> 00:25:40,599
Don't make me worry.

607
00:25:44,759 --> 00:25:45,559
I know.

608
00:25:46,400 --> 00:25:47,640
I'll listen to the doctor

609
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,119
and take my time to recover.

610
00:25:51,680 --> 00:25:53,039
I can't do anything about you.

611
00:25:53,799 --> 00:25:55,559
I have a video conference later.

612
00:25:55,559 --> 00:25:56,519
After that,

613
00:25:56,519 --> 00:25:57,839
let's go out for dinner together.
